    "subject": "Your Flow-Like code",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no, url=no\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n<title>Your Flow-Like code</title>\n<!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><style>table, td, p, a, span, h1 { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important; }</style><![endif]-->\n<style>\n:root { color-scheme: light dark; supported-color-schemes: light dark; }\nbody, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\ntable, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }\na[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n@media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\n  .fl-pad { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }\n  .fl-title { font-size: 24px !important; line-height: 30px !important; }\n  .fl-label, .fl-value { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .fl-label { padding: 10px 0 0 0 !important; }\n  .fl-value { padding: 2px 0 10px 0 !important; text-align: left !important; border-top: 0 !important; }\n}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .fl-page { background-color: #0c0c11 !important; }\n  .fl-card { background-color: #16161e !important; border-color: #2a2a35 !important; }\n  .fl-panel { background-color: #1e1e28 !important; border-top-color: #2e2e3a !important; border-right-color: #2e2e3a !important; border-bottom-color: #2e2e3a !important; }\n  .fl-ink { color: #f2f2f6 !important; }\n  .fl-body { color: #d6d6de !important; }\n  .fl-muted { color: #a7a7b5 !important; }\n  .fl-subtle { color: #868696 !important; }\n  .fl-rule { border-color: #2e2e3a !important; }\n  .fl-link { color: #a5b4fc !important; }\n  .fl-code { background-color: #23233a !important; color: #c7d2fe !important; }\n  .fl-outline { border-color: #3a3a48 !important; }\n}\n[data-ogsc] .fl-ink { color: #f2f2f6 !important; }\n[data-ogsc] .fl-body { color: #d6d6de !important; }\n[data-ogsc] .fl-muted { color: #a7a7b5 !important; }\n[data-ogsc] .fl-subtle { color: #868696 !important; }\n[data-ogsc] .fl-link { color: #a5b4fc !important; }\n[data-ogsb] .fl-page { background-color: #0c0c11 !important; }\n[data-ogsb] .fl-card { background-color: #16161e !important; }\n[data-ogsb] .fl-panel { background-color: #1e1e28 !important; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"fl-page\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#f3f3f7;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f3f3f7;\">Use this code to continue on Flow-Like.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"fl-page\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f3f3f7\" style=\"width:100%;background-color:#f3f3f7;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px 40px 12px;\">\n<!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"fl-shell\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 18px 4px;\"><span class=\"fl-ink\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:#16161d;\"><span style=\"color:#6366f1;\">&#10022;</span>&nbsp;Flow-Like</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"fl-card\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e4ea;border-radius:16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td height=\"4\" bgcolor=\"#6366f1\" style=\"height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:4px;background-color:#6366f1;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#3b82f6,#8b5cf6,#ec4899);border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:36px 40px 24px 40px;\"><p class=\"fl-link\" style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4f46e5;\">Verification</p><h1 class=\"fl-ink fl-title\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:#16161d;\">Your Flow-Like code</h1><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c68;\">Enter this code in Flow-Like to continue.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:4px 40px 24px 40px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"fl-code\" bgcolor=\"#eef0ff\" style=\"background-color:#eef0ff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 24px;\"><span class=\"fl-code\" style=\"font-family:'SFMono-Regular', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;font-size:30px;line-height:36px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#312e81;\">{####}</span></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:0px 40px 16px 40px;\"><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c68;\">It confirms this email address, or lets you choose a new password, and works only for a short time.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:0px 40px 16px 40px;\"><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#5c5c68;\">Didn’t ask for a code? You can ignore this email: nothing changes without it.</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td height=\"12\" style=\"height:12px;line-height:12px;font-size:12px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 24px 0 24px;text-align:center;\"><p class=\"fl-subtle\" style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#7c7c8a;\">You’re receiving this because this address was entered on Flow-Like.</p><p class=\"fl-subtle\" style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#7c7c8a;\">Questions? Write to <a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"mailto:help@great-co.de\" style=\"color:#4f46e5;text-decoration:underline;\">help@great-co.de</a></p><p class=\"fl-subtle\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#7c7c8a;\">&copy; Flow-Like by Rheosoph GmbH</p></td></tr>\n</table>\n<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
